<%- include('../partials/admin-open', { title, user, section: 'economy', admIsAdmin: isAdmin }) %>
<%
  const fmt = (x) => Math.round(Number(x) || 0).toLocaleString('en-US');
  const ago = (t) => { if (!t) return 'never'; const s = Math.max(0, Math.round((Date.now() - t) / 1000)); return s < 90 ? s + 's ago' : s < 5400 ? Math.round(s / 60) + 'm ago' : s < 172800 ? Math.round(s / 3600) + 'h ago' : Math.round(s / 86400) + 'd ago'; };
  const R = reserve, L = loans, T = (roy && roy.totals) || {};
%>
<div class="adm-head">
  <h1>Economy</h1>
  <p>The Federal Reserve and what the site pays out of it, loans, PAT grants, redemption codes, pad royalties and the prize shop. Rewards the site pays are funded from a vault, never minted.</p>
</div>

<section class="adm-card" id="reserve" aria-labelledby="reserveT">
  <h2 id="reserveT">Federal Reserve &amp; today's flows <span class="adm-pill admin">admins</span></h2>
  <p class="adm-help">The Reserve lives in Pepe; he syncs its balance here. Site payouts from it (level-ups, welcome and connect bonuses, codes…) are booked as claims that Pepe settles by draining his Reserve. If a vault can't cover a payout, it's skipped.</p>
  <% if (!isAdmin) { %><p class="adm-help">Admins only.</p><% } else if (!R) { %><p class="adm-help">Couldn't read the Reserve numbers.</p><% } else { %>
    <div class="adm-kv">
      <div><b>Balance (from Pepe)</b><span><%= R.balance === null ? 'never synced' : fmt(R.balance) + ' PAT' %></span></div>
      <div><b>Last sync</b><span><%= ago(R.syncedAt) %></span></div>
      <div><b>Unsettled site claims</b><span><%= fmt(R.unsettled) %> PAT</span></div>
      <div><b>Paid out today (UTC)</b><span><%= fmt(R.todayTotal) %> PAT</span></div>
      <% if (R.jackpot !== null) { %><div><b>Casino jackpot</b><span><%= fmt(R.jackpot) %> PAT</span></div><% } %>
    </div>
    <div class="adm-tbl"><table aria-label="Reserve payouts today by flow">
      <thead><tr><th>Flow (today, UTC)</th><th class="num">Payouts</th><th class="num">PAT</th></tr></thead>
      <tbody>
        <% if (!R.today.length) { %><tr><td colspan="3" class="empty">No Reserve payouts today.</td></tr><% } %>
        <% R.today.forEach((f) => { %><tr><td><code><%= f.flow %></code></td><td class="num"><%= fmt(f.n) %></td><td class="num"><%= fmt(f.t) %></td></tr><% }) %>
      </tbody>
    </table></div>
  <% } %>
</section>

<section class="adm-card" id="burn" aria-labelledby="burnT">
  <h2 id="burnT">🔥 Burn reserve <span class="adm-pill admin">admins</span></h2>
  <p class="adm-help">The last step of the weekly surplus waterfall: once the incentive buffer and the Reserve's 25M target are full, the leftover moves into Pepe's burn reserve and is destroyed (total supply goes down). Nothing else feeds it and no other pool can be burned. In <b>accrual</b> mode Pepe burns it at his next burn tick; in <b>batch</b> mode it waits for a burn here (or <code>!burn</code> in chat). Mode and caps are on Pepe's admin panel. Public log: <a href="/economy#burned">/economy#burned</a>.</p>
  <% if (!isAdmin) { %><p class="adm-help">Admins only.</p><% } else { %>
    <div id="burnAdm" data-csrf="<%= typeof pepeCtlCsrf === 'function' ? pepeCtlCsrf(me.username) : '' %>">
      <div class="adm-kv" id="burnKv"><div><b>Status</b><span>loading…</span></div></div>
      <form class="adm-form" id="burnForm" autocomplete="off">
        <label for="burnAmt">Amount (PAT)<input type="number" id="burnAmt" min="1" step="1" required></label>
        <label for="burnWhy">Reason<input type="text" id="burnWhy" maxlength="200" placeholder="what this burn is"></label>
        <div class="adm-actions"><button type="submit">Preview burn…</button></div>
      </form>
      <div id="burnConfirm" hidden>
        <p class="adm-help" id="burnWhat"></p>
        <label for="burnPw" class="adm-help">Confirm with your account password</label>
        <input type="password" id="burnPw" maxlength="200" autocomplete="current-password">
        <div class="adm-actions"><button type="button" id="burnYes">Burn it for good</button><button type="button" id="burnNo" class="adm-btn ghost">Cancel</button></div>
      </div>
      <p class="adm-msg" id="burnMsg" role="status"></p>
      <div class="adm-tbl"><table aria-label="Recent burns">
        <thead><tr><th>When (UTC)</th><th class="num">PAT</th><th>Reason</th><th>By</th></tr></thead>
        <tbody id="burnRows"><tr><td colspan="4" class="empty">loading…</td></tr></tbody>
      </table></div>
    </div>
    <script src="/public/js/admin-burn.js?v=1" defer></script>
  <% } %>
</section>

<section class="adm-card" id="loans" aria-labelledby="loansT">
  <h2 id="loansT">Loans &amp; credit <span class="adm-pill admin">admins</span></h2>
  <p class="adm-help">Reserve loan requests are approved or declined on the wallet page (its admin sections show each requester's live credit score). Pepe sends the loan book; rates and limits are his.</p>
  <% if (!isAdmin) { %><p class="adm-help">Admins only.</p><% } else if (!L || !L.known) { %><p class="adm-help">No loan data from Pepe yet.</p><% } else { %>
    <div class="adm-kv">
      <div><b>Pending requests</b><span><%= L.pending %><%= L.pending && isFinite(L.oldest) ? ' · oldest ' + ago(L.oldest * (L.oldest < 1e12 ? 1000 : 1)) : '' %></span></div>
      <div><b>Open Reserve loans</b><span><%= L.reserveOpen %></span></div>
      <div><b>Outstanding book</b><span><%= L.book == null ? '—' : fmt(L.book) + ' PAT' %></span></div>
      <div><b>Room left</b><span><%= L.room == null ? '—' : fmt(L.room) + ' PAT' %></span></div>
      <div><b>Reserve lending</b><span><%= L.enabled === null ? '—' : L.enabled ? 'open' : 'closed' %></span></div>
      <div><b>Synced</b><span><%= ago(L.updated) %></span></div>
    </div>
  <% } %>
  <div class="adm-actions" style="margin-top:10px">
    <a class="adm-btn ghost" href="/wallet#admin-requests">Loan requests ›</a>
    <a class="adm-btn ghost" href="/wallet#admin-book">Reserve book ›</a>
    <a class="adm-btn ghost" href="/wallet#admin-stashes">All stashes ›</a>
  </div>
</section>

<div class="adm-cols">
  <section class="adm-card" id="grants" aria-labelledby="grantsT">
    <h2 id="grantsT">PAT grant</h2>
    <p class="adm-help">Adds PAT straight to an account's balance as a "staff transfer" in their history (the old "Points panel"). It doesn't come out of the Reserve.</p>
    <form id="pointsTransferForm" class="adm-form" action="/api/admin/transfer/username" method="POST">
      <label for="pointsUsername">Username<input type="text" id="pointsUsername" name="username" required autocomplete="off"></label>
      <label for="pointsAmount">Amount (PAT)<input type="number" id="pointsAmount" name="amount" required></label>
      <div class="adm-actions"><button type="submit">Grant PAT</button><span id="transferStatus" class="adm-msg" role="status"></span></div>
    </form>
  </section>

  <section class="adm-card" id="codes" aria-labelledby="codesT">
    <h2 id="codesT">Redemption codes</h2>
    <p class="adm-help">Codes members redeem for PAT (paid through the <code>redeem_codes</code> flow). Click a code to see who used it.</p>
    <form id="redemption-codes" class="adm-form" action="/api/admin/redemption-codes" method="post">
      <label for="code">Code<input type="text" id="code" name="code" required autocomplete="off"></label>
      <label for="points">PAT value<input type="number" id="points" name="points" required></label>
      <label for="uses_allowed">Uses<input type="number" id="uses_allowed" name="uses_allowed" required></label>
      <label for="expiration_date">Expires<input type="date" id="expiration_date" name="expiration_date"></label>
      <div class="adm-actions"><button type="submit">Save code</button><span id="codeStatus" class="adm-msg" role="status"></span></div>
    </form>
    <h3>Existing codes</h3>
    <div id="redemptionCodesList" class="adm-chips"></div>
  </section>
</div>

<section class="adm-card" id="royalties" aria-labelledby="royT">
  <h2 id="royT">Pad owner royalties</h2>
  <p class="adm-help">What pad owners earn on spending in their pads. Rates and payout rules are set on <a href="/pads/admin#royalties">Pads › Owner royalties</a>.</p>
  <div class="adm-kv">
    <div><b>Pending</b><span><%= fmt(T.pending) %> PAT</span></div>
    <div><b>Paid out by the Fed</b><span><%= fmt(T.paid) %> PAT</span></div>
    <div><b>Expired</b><span><%= fmt(T.expired) %> PAT</span></div>
    <div><b>Earned all-time</b><span><%= fmt(T.earned) %> PAT</span></div>
    <% if (roy && roy.next_release) { %><div><b>Next release</b><span><%= new Date(roy.next_release).toISOString().slice(0, 16).replace('T', ' ') %> UTC</span></div><% } %>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="adm-card" id="econ-telemetry" aria-labelledby="econT">
  <h2 id="econT">Economy telemetry <span class="adm-pill admin">admins</span></h2>
  <p class="adm-help">Economy v2, phase E-0: measurement only, nothing is paid. The last 7 days per room: revenue by flow (every PAT flow Pepe routes, tagged with its room), verified watch-minutes from the stage players (one session per account, visible + playing; the streamer and linked accounts excluded, likely alts counted apart), participants (&ge; 10 chat lines or &ge; 5 mic minutes that day), and a <b>dry run</b>: what the 50/50 split would have put in the room's vault and what the room-vault recipe (10%/day, owner 15 / gang 15 / streamers 25 / participants 35 / games 10) would have paid from an empty vault. Gang and room-games slices are 0 until those phases exist; the room reward top-up would ask 1:1 of "paid". Burn reserve: 0 (no Treasury epoch yet).</p>
  <div id="econ-tel-status" class="adm-help">Loading…</div>
  <div class="adm-tbl"><table>
    <thead><tr><th>Room</th><th class="num">Revenue 7d</th><th>Top flows</th><th class="num">50/50 to vault</th><th class="num">to Fort Knox</th><th class="num">VWM (alt / self)</th><th class="num">Participants/day</th><th class="num">Recipe would pay</th><th class="num">Vault after 7d</th></tr></thead>
    <tbody id="econ-tel-rows"><tr><td colspan="9" class="empty">…</td></tr></tbody>
  </table></div>
  <p class="adm-help" id="econ-tel-foot"></p>
</section>

<section class="adm-card" id="shop" aria-labelledby="shopT">
  <h2 id="shopT">Prize shop</h2>
  <p class="adm-help">Member listings, orders, disputes and the shop's fee settings have their own admin page; official (site) prizes have the older manager.</p>
  <div class="adm-kv">
    <div><b>Listings awaiting review</b><span><%= shop ? shop.review : '—' %></span></div>
    <div><b>Disputed orders</b><span><%= shop ? shop.disputes : '—' %></span></div>
  </div>
  <div class="adm-actions" style="margin-top:10px">
    <a class="adm-btn ghost" href="/shop/admin">Prize shop admin ›</a>
    <a class="adm-btn ghost" href="/admin/manage-prizes">Official prizes ›</a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="adm-card" id="elsewhere" aria-labelledby="elseT">
  <h2 id="elseT">On Pepe's admin panel, not here</h2>
  <p class="adm-help">These are Pepe's and are changed from his own admin panel (or chat commands), not from the website:</p>
  <ul class="adm-list">
    <li><b>PAT Routing</b> - which vault each flow pays from / into, including the pad-owner share.</li>
    <li><b>Automint</b> and <b>vaults</b> (vault flows, the share of all Reserve outflows).</li>
    <li><b>Reserve top-ups</b> and the Reserve loan rate and limits.</li>
    <li><b>Burn reserve</b> mode (accrual / batch) and the manual-burn caps.</li>
    <li><b>Casino bans</b> (the site only stores the flag Pepe sets).</li>
  </ul>
</section>
<script src="/public/js/admin-panel.js?v=3" defer></script>
<%- include('../partials/admin-close') %>
</body>
</html>
